  "question": {
    "text": "A solid <math> <mrow> <mtext>XY</mtext></mrow> </math> has <math> <mrow> <mtext>NaCl</mtext></mrow> </math> structure. If radius of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> is <math> <mrow> <mtext>100&nbsp;pm</mtext><mtext>.</mtext></mrow> </math> What is the radius of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> ion:",
