  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For <math> <mrow> <mtext>NaCl</mtext></mrow> </math> like structure. The radius ratio should be <math> <mrow> <mn>0.414</mn></mrow> </math> to <math> <mrow> <mn>0.732</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.414</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.732</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>241.6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>&nbsp;<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><msub> <mtext>r</mtext> <mrow> <mtext>min</mtext></mrow> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>136.6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>pm</mtext></mrow> </math>",
